       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    NWC610.
       AUTHOR.        P. GONZALES.
       INSTALLATION.  NORTHWIND TRADERS - DALLAS DIVISION.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  07/22/91.
      *****************************************************************
      *  ORDER INQUIRY
      *
      *  07/22/91 PG         NEW
      *  09/30/95 PG   PG95  MOVED TO NORTHWIND FILES (ORDHDR, ORDDTL)
      *  01/20/00 AW   AW00  Y2K - DATES ON FILE ARE CYYMMDD
      *  05/05/04 AW   AW04  CUSTOMER FILTER IN LDA (FROM NWC100)
      *  02/11/06 RS   RS06  OPTION 4 = CANCEL, PUTS STOCK BACK
      *  02/11/06 RS   RS06  OPTION 6 = PRINT INVOICE (NWC620C)
      *
      *  READS THE WHOLE ORDER FILE EVERY TIME - THERE WAS NO LOGICAL
      *  BY CUSTOMER WE COULD USE FROM COBOL (SEE ORDHDRL1).
      *  INDICATORS: 03 EXIT 05 REFRESH 12 CANCEL 31-38 SUBFILES
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           LOCAL-DATA IS LDA-NAME.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DSPFILE ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-NWC610D-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
               FILE STATUS IS WS-DSP-STAT.
           SELECT ORDHDR ASSIGN TO DATABASE-ORDHDR
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS OH-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-ORDHDR-STAT.
           SELECT ORDDTL ASSIGN TO DATABASE-ORDDTL
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS OD-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-ORDDTL-STAT.
           SELECT CUSMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CUSMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS CM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CUSMST-STAT.
           SELECT PRDMST ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PRDMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS PM-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-PRDMST-STAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DSPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSP-REC                     PIC X(2000).
       FD  ORDHDR
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY ORDHDRCP.
       FD  ORDDTL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY ORDDTLCP.
       FD  CUSMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CUSMSTCP.
       FD  PRDMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY PRDMSTCP.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-SFL-CNT                  PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-DSP-STAT                 PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ORDHDR-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ORDDTL-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-CUSMST-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-PRDMST-STAT              PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-MSG-LINE                 PIC X(78) VALUE SPACES.
       77  WS-ORD-NO                   PIC S9(7) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-ORD-ED                   PIC Z(6)9.
       77  WS-ITEMS                    PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-EXT                      PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-SAVE-CUST                PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
      *  DATE CONVERSION WORK FIELDS (SAME AS NWC620)
       77  WS-CYMD                     PIC 9(7)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-CYY                      PIC 999   VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-CC                       PIC 9     VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-YY                       PIC 99    VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-MMDD                     PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZERO.
       77  WS-MDY6                     PIC 9(6)  VALUE ZERO.
      *  LOCAL DATA AREA - CUSTOMER FILTER (POS 1-5)                    AW04
      *  NOBODY CLEARS IT, SO THE LAST CUSTOMER STAYS IN THE FILTER     AW04
       01  WS-LDA.                                                      AW04
           05  LDA-CUST                PIC X(5).                        AW04
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(1019).                     AW04
       01  WS-IND-AREA.
           05  WS-IND      PIC 1 OCCURS 99 TIMES INDICATOR 1.
       01  SFLREC-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-I OF NWC610D.
       01  SFLREC-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLREC-O OF NWC610D.
       01  SFLCTL-I-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-I OF NWC610D.
       01  SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-SFLCTL-O OF NWC610D.
       01  FMT01-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-FMT01-O OF NWC610D.
       01  LINSFL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-LINSFL-O OF NWC610D.
       01  LINCTL-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-LINCTL-O OF NWC610D.
       01  DSPFTR-O-AREA.
           COPY DDS-DSPFTR-O OF NWC610D.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           OPEN I-O DSPFILE.
           OPEN I-O ORDHDR ORDDTL PRDMST.
           OPEN INPUT CUSMST.
           MOVE ALL "0" TO WS-IND-AREA.
           INITIALIZE SFLCTL-I-AREA SFLCTL-O-AREA.
           ACCEPT WS-LDA FROM LDA-NAME.                                 AW04
           MOVE LDA-CUST TO C1CUST OF SFLCTL-O.                         AW04
           MOVE LDA-CUST TO C1CUST OF SFLCTL-I.                         AW04
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT.
       0100-SHOW-LIST.
           MOVE WS-MSG-LINE TO MSGLIN OF FMT01-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM FMT01-O-AREA FORMAT IS "FMT01"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE INTO SFLCTL-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG-LINE.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" OR WS-IND(12) = B"1"
               GO TO 9000-END-PGM.
           IF WS-IND(05) = B"1"
              OR C1CUST OF SFLCTL-I NOT = WS-SAVE-CUST
               PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT
               GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
           PERFORM 2000-OPTIONS THRU 2000-EXIT.
           PERFORM 1000-LOAD-SFL THRU 1000-EXIT.
           GO TO 0100-SHOW-LIST.
       9000-END-PGM.
           CLOSE DSPFILE ORDHDR ORDDTL PRDMST CUSMST.
           GOBACK.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  1000 - LOAD THE SUBFILE.  READS EVERY ORDER ON FILE AND SKIPS
      *         THE ONES FOR OTHER CUSTOMERS.  STOPS AT 999.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-LOAD-SFL.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(31).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(32).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM SFLCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(33).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE C1CUST OF SFLCTL-I TO WS-SAVE-CUST.
           MOVE WS-SAVE-CUST TO C1CUST OF SFLCTL-O.
           MOVE ZERO TO OH-ORD-NO.
           START ORDHDR KEY IS NOT LESS THAN OH-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 1000-DONE.
       1000-READ.
           READ ORDHDR NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 1000-DONE.
           IF WS-SAVE-CUST NOT = SPACES AND OH-CUST NOT = WS-SAVE-CUST
               GO TO 1000-READ.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE SPACE TO S1OPT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE OH-ORD-NO TO S1ORD OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE OH-ORD-NO TO H1ORD OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE OH-CUST TO S1CUST OF SFLREC-O.
      *  CUSTOMER NAME - ONE READ PER ORDER
           MOVE OH-CUST TO CM-CUST.
           READ CUSMST INVALID KEY MOVE "*NOT ON FILE" TO CM-NAME.
           MOVE CM-NAME TO S1CNAM OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE OH-ODAT TO WS-CYMD.
           PERFORM 7000-CYMD-TO-MDY THRU 7000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MDY6 TO S1ODAT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE OH-STAT TO S1STAT OF SFLREC-O.
           MOVE OH-TOTL TO S1TOTL OF SFLREC-O.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM SFLREC-O-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-RRN < 999 GO TO 1000-READ.
           MOVE "ONLY THE FIRST 999 ORDERS ARE SHOWN" TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       1000-DONE.
           MOVE WS-RRN TO WS-SFL-CNT.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(32).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(34).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO
               MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(31)
           ELSE
               MOVE "NO ORDERS FOUND" TO WS-MSG-LINE.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  2000 - OPTIONS
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-OPTIONS.
           READ SUBFILE DSPFILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
               INTO SFLREC-I-AREA FORMAT IS "SFLREC"
               AT END GO TO 2000-EXIT.
           MOVE H1ORD OF SFLREC-I TO WS-ORD-NO.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "4"
               PERFORM 4000-CANCEL THRU 4000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "5"
               PERFORM 5000-DISPLAY THRU 5000-EXIT.
           IF S1OPT OF SFLREC-I = "6"
               CALL "NWC620C" USING WS-ORD-NO
               MOVE WS-ORD-NO TO WS-ORD-ED
               STRING "INVOICE PRINTED FOR ORDER " DELIMITED BY SIZE
                      WS-ORD-ED DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-MSG-LINE.
           GO TO 2000-OPTIONS.
       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  4000 - CANCEL.  NO CONFIRMATION.  STOCK IS PUT BACK.           RS06
      *         (THE RPG NW610R DOES NOT PUT STOCK BACK)                RS06
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       4000-CANCEL.                                                     RS06
           MOVE WS-ORD-NO TO OH-ORD-NO.                                 RS06
           READ ORDHDR INVALID KEY                                      RS06
               MOVE "ORDER NOT FOUND" TO WS-MSG-LINE                    RS06
               GO TO 4000-EXIT.                                         RS06
           IF OH-STAT = "S"                                             RS06
               MOVE "ORDER HAS SHIPPED - CANNOT CANCEL" TO WS-MSG-LINE
               GO TO 4000-EXIT.                                         RS06
           IF OH-STAT = "C"                                             RS06
               MOVE "ORDER IS ALREADY CANCELLED" TO WS-MSG-LINE         RS06
               GO TO 4000-EXIT.                                         RS06
           MOVE "C" TO OH-STAT.                                         RS06
           REWRITE ORDHDR-REC INVALID KEY CONTINUE END-REWRITE.         RS06
           MOVE WS-ORD-NO TO OD-ORD-NO.                                 RS06
           MOVE ZERO TO OD-LIN-NO.                                      RS06
           START ORDDTL KEY IS NOT LESS THAN OD-KEY                     RS06
               INVALID KEY GO TO 4000-DONE.                             RS06
       4000-READ.                                                       RS06
           READ ORDDTL NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 4000-DONE.              RS06
           IF OD-ORD-NO NOT = WS-ORD-NO GO TO 4000-DONE.                RS06
           MOVE OD-PRD-NO TO PM-PRD-NO.                                 RS06
           READ PRDMST INVALID KEY GO TO 4000-READ.                     RS06
           ADD OD-QTY TO PM-STCK.                                       RS06
           REWRITE PRDMST-REC INVALID KEY CONTINUE END-REWRITE.         RS06
           GO TO 4000-READ.                                             RS06
       4000-DONE.                                                       RS06
           MOVE WS-ORD-NO TO WS-ORD-ED.                                 RS06
           STRING "ORDER " DELIMITED BY SIZE WS-ORD-ED DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  " CANCELLED" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-MSG-LINE.      RS06
       4000-EXIT.                                                       RS06
           EXIT.                                                        RS06
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  5000 - DISPLAY ONE ORDER WITH ITS LINES.  THE EXTENDED PRICE
      *         IS WORKED OUT AGAIN HERE (THE INVOICE USES ODEXT)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       5000-DISPLAY.
           MOVE WS-ORD-NO TO OH-ORD-NO.
           READ ORDHDR INVALID KEY
               MOVE "ORDER NOT FOUND" TO WS-MSG-LINE
               GO TO 5000-EXIT.
           INITIALIZE LINCTL-O-AREA DSPFTR-O-AREA.
           MOVE OH-ORD-NO TO D1ORD OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-CUST TO D1CUST OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-CUST TO CM-CUST.
           READ CUSMST INVALID KEY MOVE "*NOT ON FILE" TO CM-NAME.
           MOVE CM-NAME TO D1CNAM OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-ODAT TO WS-CYMD.
           PERFORM 7000-CYMD-TO-MDY THRU 7000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MDY6 TO D1ODAT OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-SDAT TO WS-CYMD.
           PERFORM 7000-CYMD-TO-MDY THRU 7000-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-MDY6 TO D1SDAT OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-STAT TO D1STAT OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-SNAM TO D1SNAM OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-SCTY TO D1SCTY OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE OH-SCNT TO D1SCNT OF LINCTL-O.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(37).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(35).
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(36).
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM LINCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "LINCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           MOVE B"0" TO WS-IND(37).
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-RRN WS-ITEMS.
           MOVE WS-ORD-NO TO OD-ORD-NO.
           MOVE ZERO TO OD-LIN-NO.
           START ORDDTL KEY IS NOT LESS THAN OD-KEY
               INVALID KEY GO TO 5000-SHOW.
       5000-READ.
           READ ORDDTL NEXT RECORD AT END GO TO 5000-SHOW.
           IF OD-ORD-NO NOT = WS-ORD-NO GO TO 5000-SHOW.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RRN.
           MOVE OD-LIN-NO TO L1LIN OF LINSFL-O.
           MOVE OD-PRD-NO TO L1PRD OF LINSFL-O.
      *  PRDMST IS OPEN I-O FOR THE CANCEL - THIS READ LOCKS IT TOO
           MOVE OD-PRD-NO TO PM-PRD-NO.
           READ PRDMST INVALID KEY MOVE "*NOT ON FILE" TO PM-NAME.
           MOVE PM-NAME TO L1NAME OF LINSFL-O.
           MOVE OD-QTY TO L1QTY OF LINSFL-O.
           MOVE OD-PRIC TO L1PRIC OF LINSFL-O.
           MOVE OD-DISC TO L1DISC OF LINSFL-O.
           COMPUTE WS-EXT ROUNDED = OD-PRIC * OD-QTY * (1 - OD-DISC).
           MOVE WS-EXT TO L1EXT OF LINSFL-O.
           ADD WS-EXT TO WS-ITEMS.
           WRITE SUBFILE DSP-REC FROM LINSFL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "LINSFL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-RRN < 100 GO TO 5000-READ.
       5000-SHOW.
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(36).
           MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(38).
           IF WS-RRN > ZERO MOVE B"1" TO WS-IND(35).
           MOVE WS-ITEMS TO D1TOT OF DSPFTR-O.
           MOVE OH-FRT TO D1FRT OF DSPFTR-O.
           MOVE OH-TOTL TO D1TOTS OF DSPFTR-O.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM DSPFTR-O-AREA FORMAT IS "DSPFTR"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           WRITE DSP-REC FROM LINCTL-O-AREA FORMAT IS "LINCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           READ DSPFILE FORMAT IS "LINCTL"
               INDICATORS ARE WS-IND-AREA.
           IF WS-IND(03) = B"1" GO TO 9000-END-PGM.
       5000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      *  7000 - CYYMMDD TO MMDDYY (COPIED INTO NWC620 AS WELL)
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       7000-CYMD-TO-MDY.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-MDY6.
           IF WS-CYMD = ZERO GO TO 7000-EXIT.
           DIVIDE WS-CYMD BY 10000 GIVING WS-CYY REMAINDER WS-MMDD.
           DIVIDE WS-CYY BY 100 GIVING WS-CC REMAINDER WS-YY.
           COMPUTE WS-MDY6 = WS-MMDD * 100 + WS-YY.
       7000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
